INSERT INTO `faqs` VALUES (1,1,'What does Softec Ai Solution do?','<p>We design, build and support custom software, web and mobile applications, AI solutions, cloud infrastructure and automation for organisations of all sizes.</p>',1,0,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(2,1,'Which industries do you work with?','<p>We work across sectors including healthcare, education, finance, retail, manufacturing, logistics, real estate, travel and professional services. See our Industries page for details.</p>',0,1,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(3,2,'How does a typical project start?','<p>With a short discovery conversation about your goals, users and constraints. We then propose an approach, team and plan — usually with a phased roadmap so you see value early.</p>',1,2,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(4,2,'Can you work with our existing team or codebase?','<p>Yes. We can extend your in-house team, take over an existing application after a code review, or deliver a complete solution end to end.</p>',1,3,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(5,2,'Who owns the code and intellectual property?','<p>Ownership terms are agreed in the contract for each engagement. Our standard approach is that clients own the custom code and data created for them.</p>',1,4,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(6,3,'How do you estimate cost?','<p>After discovery we provide a transparent estimate based on scope, complexity and team size. We offer fixed-scope, dedicated-team and time-and-materials engagement models.</p>',1,5,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(7,3,'Do you offer ongoing support after launch?','<p>Yes. Maintenance and support plans cover security updates, monitoring, bug fixes and continuous improvements.</p>',0,6,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(8,4,'How do you keep our data safe when using AI?','<p>We design AI solutions with data protection in mind — limiting what data models can access, using providers and configurations that meet your requirements, and adding human review where decisions matter.</p>',1,7,1,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 02:36:55'),(9,5,'How do we know if AI is right for our problem?','<p>We start with an assessment of the business problem, available data and risks. Sometimes the best answer is AI; sometimes simpler automation or analytics delivers the value more reliably.</p>',0,0,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(10,5,'What data do we need for machine learning?','<p>Predictive models usually need relevant historical data that reflects real conditions. We assess data quality and availability early and can help build the data foundations if needed.</p>',0,1,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(11,5,'How do you keep models accurate after launch?','<p>We monitor model performance, track data drift and retrain or adjust models when accuracy declines, with clear processes for review and approval.</p>',0,2,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(12,5,'What if one of our systems has no API?','<p>We can build an integration layer, use secure database or file-based exchanges, or, where appropriate, automate the user interface. We recommend the most reliable option available for each system.</p>',0,3,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(13,5,'How do you keep integrations reliable?','<p>We design for failure with retries, queues, idempotent processing, monitoring and alerts, and document every integration so issues can be diagnosed quickly.</p>',0,4,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(14,5,'Can you build APIs for partners or customers?','<p>Yes. We design versioned, documented APIs with authentication, rate limiting and usage monitoring so partners can integrate securely.</p>',0,5,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(15,5,'Which processes should we automate first?','<p>Start with frequent, rule-driven, error-prone processes that have clear owners and digital inputs, such as invoice processing, onboarding, order entry or report generation. We help you score and prioritise candidates.</p>',0,6,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(16,5,'Do we need to replace our existing systems?','<p>Usually not. Automation typically connects and orchestrates your existing systems through APIs, integration layers or, where necessary, user-interface automation.</p>',0,7,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(17,5,'How are exceptions handled?','<p>We design automations to process the common path automatically and route exceptions to the right person with all relevant context, so nothing gets lost.</p>',0,8,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(18,5,'Which cloud provider do you recommend?','<p>AWS, Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud are all capable platforms. We recommend a provider based on your existing technology, required services, team skills and commercial considerations.</p>',0,9,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(19,5,'How do you minimise downtime during migration?','<p>We migrate in planned waves, rehearse cut-overs and data migrations, use synchronisation where needed and prepare tested rollback plans for every step.</p>',0,10,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(20,5,'Will moving to the cloud reduce our costs?','<p>It can, particularly with right-sizing, automation and decommissioning of legacy infrastructure. We set up cost visibility and optimisation so spending stays under control.</p>',0,11,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(21,5,'Should we customise an existing CRM/ERP or build our own?','<p>Established platforms suit many organisations with sensible configuration. A custom system or custom modules make sense when your processes are distinctive or platforms require heavy workarounds. We help you evaluate both objectively.</p>',0,12,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(22,5,'Can you migrate data from our current system?','<p>Yes. We plan data migrations carefully: mapping, cleaning, test migrations and validation, so the new system starts with accurate, trustworthy data.</p>',0,13,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(23,5,'Will our team need training?','<p>Yes, adoption is essential. We provide role-based training, documentation and support during roll-out so people are confident using the new system.</p>',0,14,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(24,5,'How long does a custom software project take?','<p>It depends on scope and complexity. We usually start with a short discovery phase, then deliver in iterations so a first valuable release reaches users as early as possible, with further features added in later phases.</p>',0,15,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(25,5,'Will we own the source code?','<p>Ownership is agreed in the contract for each engagement. Our standard approach is that clients own the custom code and data created for them, with full access to the repository and documentation.</p>',0,16,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(26,5,'Can you integrate the software with our existing systems?','<p>Yes. Most custom software connects to existing tools such as CRMs, ERPs, accounting packages, identity providers and databases through APIs or purpose-built integration services.</p>',0,17,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(27,5,'Where should a growing business start with cybersecurity?','<p>Multi-factor authentication, automatic updates, tested backups and least-privilege access address many common threats. An assessment then identifies the next priorities for your specific risks.</p>',0,18,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(28,5,'Do you review the security of web applications?','<p>Yes. We review architecture, code and configuration against widely used guidance such as the OWASP Top 10 and provide prioritised, practical remediation advice.</p>',0,19,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(29,5,'Can you help us prepare for an incident?','<p>Yes. We help write a concise incident response plan, define roles and communication paths, and run tabletop exercises so your team is ready.</p>',0,20,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(30,5,'Which BI tools do you work with?','<p>We work with established tools such as Power BI and modern data stacks including cloud data warehouses and transformation tools. We recommend tools based on your existing systems, skills and budget.</p>',0,21,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(31,5,'Our data is spread across many systems. Can you help?','<p>Yes. We build pipelines that consolidate data from your applications into a central warehouse, with cleaning, modelling and quality checks so reports are consistent.</p>',0,22,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(32,5,'Can managers create their own reports?','<p>Yes. With well-modelled data and governed self-service dashboards, business users can explore data and answer questions without waiting for technical teams.</p>',0,23,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(33,5,'What does a CI/CD pipeline include?','<p>Typically automated builds, tests, code-quality and security checks, and deployments to staging and production, with approvals where required and the ability to roll back quickly.</p>',0,24,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(34,5,'Can you work with our existing tools?','<p>Yes. We work with common platforms such as GitHub Actions and GitLab CI and with major cloud providers, improving what you have rather than replacing tools unnecessarily.</p>',0,25,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(35,5,'How does DevOps improve security?','<p>Automated dependency and vulnerability scanning, secret management, reviewed infrastructure changes and consistent environments reduce human error and catch issues earlier.</p>',0,26,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(36,5,'What does a digital transformation engagement involve?','<p>Typically an assessment of current processes and technology, a prioritised roadmap balancing quick wins with longer-term change, and support to deliver and measure initiatives.</p>',0,27,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(37,5,'How do you ensure staff adopt new ways of working?','<p>We involve teams early, design changes around their real work, communicate clearly and provide training and support, measuring adoption as well as delivery.</p>',0,28,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(38,5,'Do you also implement the roadmap?','<p>Yes. Our engineering, data, cloud and AI teams can deliver the initiatives in the roadmap, or we can support your internal teams and other partners.</p>',0,29,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(39,5,'Do you build on platforms like Shopify or WooCommerce?','<p>Yes. We work with established platforms when they fit, and build custom or headless solutions when you need unique pricing logic, complex catalogues or deep integrations.</p>',0,30,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(40,5,'Can you integrate our inventory and ERP systems?','<p>Yes. We connect storefronts to inventory, ERP, shipping, accounting and marketing tools so orders, stock and customer data stay in sync across channels.</p>',0,31,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(41,5,'How do you improve checkout conversion?','<p>We focus on fast pages, a short and clear checkout, trusted payment options, transparent delivery information and accessible forms, then use analytics to identify and fix drop-off points.</p>',0,32,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(42,5,'What is the difference between an AI assistant and an AI agent?','<p>An assistant answers questions and drafts content. An agent can also plan multi-step tasks and take actions through tools you control, such as creating tickets or updating records, with approval steps where needed.</p>',0,33,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(43,5,'How do you stop AI from giving wrong answers?','<p>We ground answers in your approved content with retrieval-augmented generation, require citations, evaluate quality with test sets, and add human review for consequential outputs.</p>',0,34,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(44,5,'Is our data safe with generative AI?','<p>We select providers and deployment options that meet your data requirements, enforce user permissions at retrieval time, minimise the data sent to models and log access for review.</p>',0,35,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(45,5,'What do managed IT services include?','<p>Typically monitoring, patch management, backup and recovery, endpoint and network management, user support and regular reviews. Scope is agreed to match your environment and needs.</p>',0,36,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(46,5,'Do you offer out-of-hours support?','<p>Support hours and response times are agreed in each service plan. Options for extended or out-of-hours cover can be arranged where your operations require it.</p>',0,37,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(47,5,'Can you work alongside our internal IT team?','<p>Yes. We can provide full managed services or co-managed support that adds capacity and specialist skills to your existing team.</p>',0,38,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(48,5,'Do you support applications built by other companies?','<p>Yes. We start with a code, security and infrastructure review, document what we find and propose a plan to stabilise, update and improve the application.</p>',0,39,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(49,5,'What is included in a maintenance plan?','<p>Plans typically cover security and dependency updates, monitoring, bug fixes, small improvements and agreed response times. Scope is tailored to the importance and complexity of each application.</p>',0,40,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(50,5,'How are support requests handled?','<p>Requests are logged, prioritised by severity and handled within the response times agreed in your plan, with regular reporting on work completed.</p>',0,41,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(51,5,'Should we build a native or cross-platform app?','<p>Cross-platform frameworks such as Flutter or React Native suit most business apps and let one codebase serve iOS and Android. Native development is preferable when you need maximum performance, platform-specific design or advanced device features.</p>',0,42,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(52,5,'Do you help publish apps to the App Store and Google Play?','<p>Yes. We prepare store listings, handle builds and signing, and guide you through the review process, including privacy declarations required by each store.</p>',0,43,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(53,5,'Can the app work offline?','<p>Yes. Apps can store data locally and synchronise when a connection is available. We design synchronisation and conflict handling around how your users actually work.</p>',0,44,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(54,5,'Can you help validate our SaaS idea before building?','<p>Yes. We run discovery workshops, prototype the core workflow and help you test it with potential customers so you invest in a minimum viable product with evidence behind it.</p>',0,45,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(55,5,'How do you handle multi-tenancy?','<p>We choose an isolation model — shared database with tenant scoping, separate schemas or separate databases — based on your security, compliance and cost requirements, and enforce tenant isolation consistently in code and tests.</p>',0,46,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(56,5,'Do you integrate subscription billing?','<p>Yes. We integrate established payment providers for plans, trials, upgrades, invoices and failed-payment handling, and build billing so pricing can evolve without major rework.</p>',0,47,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(57,5,'Do you design for both web and mobile?','<p>Yes. We design responsive web applications and native or cross-platform mobile apps, keeping experiences consistent across devices through shared design systems.</p>',0,48,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(58,5,'How do you validate designs?','<p>We test prototypes with real or representative users, observe where they struggle and refine the design before development, reducing costly changes later.</p>',0,49,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(59,5,'Can you improve the design of an existing product?','<p>Yes. We can audit usability and accessibility, prioritise improvements and redesign key journeys or the full interface in phases.</p>',0,50,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(60,5,'Which technologies do you use for web applications?','<p>We commonly use Laravel, Node.js, React, Next.js, Vue.js and Tailwind CSS, with MySQL or PostgreSQL databases. We choose the stack based on your requirements, existing systems and long-term maintainability.</p>',0,51,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(61,5,'Will the web application work on mobile devices?','<p>Yes. We build responsive, mobile-first interfaces that adapt to phones, tablets and desktops, and can add progressive web app features such as installation and offline support where useful.</p>',0,52,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(62,5,'How do you make web applications fast and secure?','<p>We optimise loading performance, use caching and efficient queries, and follow secure coding practices including input validation, output escaping, strong authentication, security headers and regular dependency updates.</p>',0,53,1,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33');
