Ai Solution','Secure patient portals, telehealth apps, scheduling and AI document processing for healthcare providers, built with privacy and accessibility in mind.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'healthcare software development',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(20,'industry',2,'Education & E-learning Software | Softec Ai Solution','Learning platforms, student information systems and AI study assistants for schools, universities and training providers — accessible and secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'education software development',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(21,'industry',3,'Fintech Software Development | Softec Ai Solution','Secure customer portals, APIs, automation and AI-driven risk insights for financial services and fintech teams, designed with security first.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'fintech software development',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(22,'industry',4,'Retail & E-commerce Software Solutions | Softec Ai Solution','Fast storefronts, unified inventory and order management, personalisation and analytics that help retailers sell more across every channel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'retail software solutions',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(23,'industry',5,'Manufacturing Software & Industry 4.0 | Softec Ai Solution','ERP integrations, production dashboards, predictive maintenance analytics and computer-vision quality checks for modern manufacturers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'manufacturing software development',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(24,'industry',6,'Logistics Software Development | Softec Ai Solution','Shipment tracking portals, route planning, warehouse mobile apps and automation that make logistics operations more visible and efficient.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'logistics software development',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(25,'industry',7,'Real Estate & PropTech Software | Softec Ai Solution','Listing portals, property CRMs, tenant apps and automated maintenance workflows for agencies, developers and property managers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'real estate software development',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(26,'industry',8,'Travel & Hospitality Software | Softec Ai Solution','Booking engines, channel integrations, guest apps and scalable cloud platforms for travel and hospitality brands that need great guest experiences.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'travel and hospitality software',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(27,'industry',9,'Professional Services Software | Softec Ai Solution','Secure client portals, AI knowledge assistants and workflow automation for consultancies, legal and accounting firms that want to work smarter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'software for professional services firms',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(28,'industry',10,'Startup & Enterprise Software | Softec Ai Solution','Lean MVPs for founders and phased modernisation for established organisations — product strategy, engineering, cloud and AI from one team.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'software development for startups',NULL,'2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(29,'page',1,'Softec Ai Solution | Custom Software, AI & Cloud Development','Softec Ai Solution builds custom software, web and mobile apps, generative AI agents and cloud platforms that help organisations work smarter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'custom software development company','custom software development, AI development company, generative AI, web application development, mobile app development, cloud migration','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(30,'page',2,'About Us | Softec Ai Solution','Meet Softec Ai Solution: an IT services and product company combining engineering, AI, cloud and design to help organisations build better software.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'software development and AI company','about Softec Ai Solution, software company, AI solutions company, IT services','2026-10-26 0