ive AI for SMEs, AI for small business, LLM use cases, AI automation ideas','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(36,'blog_post',9,'Web App vs Mobile App vs PWA: Which to Build First?','Compare web apps, native and cross-platform mobile apps and PWAs on reach, cost, device features and UX to choose the right first platform.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'web app vs mobile app','progressive web app, native app vs web app, cross-platform app, Flutter vs native','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(37,'blog_post',10,'SaaS Product Development: From MVP to Scale','Build a SaaS product the right way: validate an MVP, choose a multi-tenant architecture, add billing and onboarding, then scale securely and reliably.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'SaaS product development','SaaS development, SaaS MVP, multi-tenant architecture, subscription billing, SaaS startup','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(38,'blog_post',11,'Business Process Automation: Where to Start','Find the processes worth automating, pick the right approach — integrations, workflow tools, RPA or AI — and roll out automation your team embraces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'business process automation','workflow automation, process automation, RPA, document automation, AI automation','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(39,'blog_post',12,'Cybersecurity Checklist for Growing Businesses','A practical cybersecurity checklist for growing businesses: MFA, patching, backups, access control, secure development and incident response planning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'cybersecurity checklist for businesses','small business cybersecurity, security checklist, MFA, backups, incident response, secure software','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(40,'blog_post',13,'Laravel for Business Web Apps: Pros, Cons & Use Cases','Is Laravel right for your business application? Explore its strengths, trade-offs, ideal use cases and how to build Laravel apps that stay maintainable.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'Laravel for business applications','Laravel development, PHP framework, Laravel pros and cons, Laravel SaaS, Laravel enterprise','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(41,'blog_post',14,'Custom Software vs Off-the-Shelf: How to Choose','Compare custom software and off-the-shelf products on fit, cost, speed, risk and ownership — with a practical framework and a hybrid approach.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'custom software vs off-the-shelf','build vs buy software, bespoke software, off-the-shelf software, SaaS vs custom','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(42,'blog_post',1,'How to Identify High-Value AI Use Cases','A step-by-step framework to find, score and prioritise AI use cases that deliver measurable business value — and avoid costly AI experiments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'AI use cases for business','AI strategy, AI opportunities, AI prioritisation, AI pilot, machine learning use cases','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(43,'blog_post',2,'Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Explained','What retrieval-augmented generation is, why it makes AI assistants more accurate, and what a secure, well-evaluated RAG implementation needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'retrieval-augmented generation','RAG, AI knowledge assistant, enterprise search AI, LLM grounding, vector database','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(44,'blog_post',3,'Cloud Migration Checklist: Plan, Migrate, Optimise','A practical cloud migration checklist covering assessment, landing zones, migration waves, cut-over, security, cost optimisation and decommissioning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'cloud migration checklist','cloud migration, AWS migration, Azure migration, cloud strategy, lift and shift, re-platforming','2026-10-26 04:04:33','2026-10-26 04:04:33'),(45,'blog_post',4,'Why Design Systems Speed Up Product Development','How design systems — tokens, components, patterns and documentation — help teams ship consistent, accessible products faster, and how to start one.',