INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (1,1,'Custom Software Development','custom-software-development','Software shaped around how your business really works','Bespoke applications that automate your workflows, connect your systems and scale with your organisation.','Off-the-shelf tools rarely fit perfectly. We design and build custom software around your processes, data and users — from internal platforms to customer-facing products — with clean architecture that is easy to maintain and extend.','<h2>Why custom software matters</h2>\n<p>Off-the-shelf tools solve common problems well, but they rarely match the way your organisation actually works. Teams end up with spreadsheets, duplicate data entry and workarounds that slow everyone down. <strong>Custom software is designed around your processes, your data and your users</strong>, so the system supports the way you create value rather than forcing you to adapt to a generic product.</p>\n<p>It also gives you ownership: no surprise licence increases, no features removed from under you and a roadmap that follows your priorities. If you are weighing the options, our guide to <a href=\"/blog/custom-software-vs-off-the-shelf-how-to-choose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">custom vs off-the-shelf software</a> sets out a practical decision framework.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Business platforms and internal tools</strong> that digitise workflows, approvals and reporting.</li>\n<li><strong>Customer and partner portals</strong> with secure, role-based access.</li>\n<li><strong>Workflow engines</strong> for complex rules such as pricing, scheduling or compliance checks.</li>\n<li><strong>Integrations</strong> with the systems you already rely on.</li>\n<li><strong>Admin consoles, dashboards and exports</strong> so your team can operate the system independently.</li>\n<li><strong>Documentation and handover</strong> so the software remains maintainable for years.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>Every engagement starts with discovery: understanding goals, mapping current processes and identifying the integrations that carry the most risk. We turn that into a prioritised roadmap with a focused first release, then build iteratively in short cycles with regular demos. Code review, automated testing and continuous integration are standard on every project, and security is designed in from the first sprint rather than added at the end.</p>\n<p>We choose proven, maintainable technologies — such as Laravel, Node.js, Python and modern front-end frameworks — based on your requirements and the skills of whoever will maintain the system long term.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>Custom software is a strong fit for organisations whose processes differentiate them, teams that have outgrown spreadsheets and generic tools, and businesses that need several systems to work together seamlessly. It suits startups validating a new product as well as established companies modernising legacy systems in phases.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Success is measured against the outcomes agreed during discovery — hours saved, errors reduced, faster turnaround, better customer experience — not simply against a feature list. You receive working software in regular increments, clear visibility of progress and a codebase that new developers can understand.</p>\n\n<h2>Planning your budget</h2>\n<p>Cost depends mainly on scope, complexity, integrations and quality expectations. Our article on <a href=\"/blog/how-much-does-custom-software-development-cost\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">custom software development cost</a> explains the drivers and how to build a reliable budget. When you are ready, <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">tell us about your project</a> and we will propose an approach, team and estimate.</p>','code-bracket',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Manual, spreadsheet-driven processes that do not scale\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Disconnected tools creating duplicate data entry\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Legacy systems that are costly to change\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Fits your exact workflows\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Full ownership of code and data\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Scales as you grow\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Lower long-term licensing costs\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Business process digitisation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Role-based portals and dashboards\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Workflow and approval engines\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Reporting and exports\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Third-party integrations\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Secure, audited access\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a custom software development project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(2,1,'Web Application Development','web-application-development','Fast, secure web apps your users enjoy','Responsive, accessible web applications built with modern frameworks and proven engineering practices.','We build web applications that load quickly, work on every device and stay secure — from customer portals and marketplaces to internal tools — with an emphasis on performance, accessibility and maintainability.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>For many organisations, the web application <em>is</em> the product: the place where customers place orders, partners collaborate and teams get work done. Slow pages, confusing journeys or security gaps directly affect revenue and trust. <strong>A well-engineered web application is fast, accessible, secure and easy to evolve</strong> as your business changes.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Customer portals</strong> for self-service accounts, orders, bookings and documents.</li>\n<li><strong>SaaS platforms</strong> with multi-tenant architecture, subscriptions and admin consoles.</li>\n<li><strong>Internal tools</strong> that replace spreadsheets and manual processes.</li>\n<li><strong>Marketplaces and booking systems</strong> with payments and notifications.</li>\n<li><strong>Content management</strong> so your team can update content without developers.</li>\n<li><strong>APIs</strong> that power mobile apps and integrations from the same backend.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We begin by understanding users and their key journeys, then prototype the most important flows before development starts. Builds are delivered iteratively with regular demos. We pay close attention to performance — fast initial loading, responsive interactions and stable layouts — because these qualities affect both user satisfaction and search visibility.</p>\n<p>Accessibility is part of our definition of done: semantic markup, keyboard support, sufficient colour contrast and clear error messages. Security practices include role-based access control, protection against common vulnerabilities, secure session handling and audit logging for sensitive actions. Automated tests and continuous integration keep quality high as features are added.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>Our web application development service suits organisations launching a new digital product, businesses replacing an outdated system and teams that need a secure portal for customers or partners. If you are unsure whether to start with web or mobile, read <a href=\"/blog/web-app-vs-mobile-app-vs-pwa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">web app vs mobile app vs PWA</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>A successful web application is fast, intuitive and dependable. Users complete tasks without training, pages respond quickly on any device, and your team can add features confidently because the codebase is tested, documented and well structured. Analytics show how people use the product, guiding the next round of improvements.</p>\n\n<h2>After launch</h2>\n<p>Web applications need ongoing care. We offer <a href=\"/services/maintenance-technical-support\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">maintenance and support</a> covering updates, monitoring and continuous improvement, and can extend your platform with new features as you grow. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Start a project</a> to discuss your requirements.</p>','window',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Slow, outdated web experiences that lose users\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Security and compliance concerns\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Hard-to-maintain codebases\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Excellent performance and Core Web Vitals\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Accessible, mobile-first interfaces\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Secure by design\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Maintainable, tested code\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"window\", \"title\": \"Progressive web apps\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"window\", \"title\": \"Customer and partner portals\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"window\", \"title\": \"Real-time features\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"window\", \"title\": \"Payment integration\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"window\", \"title\": \"Content management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"window\", \"title\": \"Analytics instrumentation\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a web application development project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',1,1,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(3,1,'Mobile Application Development','mobile-application-development','Native-quality apps for iOS and Android','Cross-platform and native mobile apps with polished UX, offline support and secure backends.','From concept to App Store and Google Play, we design and build mobile apps that feel native, perform well and connect securely to your systems. We choose cross-platform or native technology based on your product goals.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Mobile apps put your service in your customers&#039; pockets and your team&#039;s hands wherever they work. A good app feels fast and natural, works reliably on poor connections and uses device features such as the camera, location and notifications to make tasks easier. <strong>A poor app is quickly uninstalled</strong> — so quality, performance and design matter from the first release.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cross-platform apps</strong> for iOS and Android from a shared codebase.</li>\n<li><strong>Native apps</strong> when performance or platform-specific features demand it.</li>\n<li><strong>Secure backends and APIs</strong> that the app relies on.</li>\n<li><strong>Offline-first experiences</strong> with reliable synchronisation.</li>\n<li><strong>Push notifications, payments and device integrations</strong> such as camera, maps and biometrics.</li>\n<li><strong>Analytics</strong> to understand usage and guide improvements.</li>\n<li><strong>App store submission</strong> and release management.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start with the journeys that matter most to users and prototype them early, testing on real devices rather than only on screens in a design tool. Development is iterative, with test builds shared regularly so you can try the app as it evolves. Automated testing, crash reporting and staged releases help catch issues before they reach all users.</p>\n<p>Security is built in: secure storage of credentials and tokens, encrypted communication, careful handling of personal data and a backend designed with least-privilege access.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>Our mobile app development service suits consumer brands building customer apps, businesses equipping field teams with mobile tools, and startups launching an app-first product. If you are still deciding between platforms, our guide on <a href=\"/blog/web-app-vs-mobile-app-vs-pwa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">web apps, mobile apps and PWAs</a> can help.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>A successful app earns a place on users&#039; home screens: it starts quickly, behaves predictably, works when the connection drops and makes everyday tasks noticeably easier. Crash reporting and analytics show stability and engagement, guiding a roadmap of improvements rather than guesswork.</p>\n\n<p>We also plan for each annual operating system release, testing betas early so your app stays compatible and takes advantage of new platform capabilities where they benefit users.</p>\n\n<h2>Beyond launch</h2>\n<p>Operating systems update every year, and apps need to keep pace. We provide ongoing updates, monitoring and new features through our <a href=\"/services/maintenance-technical-support\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">maintenance and support</a> plans. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tell us about your app idea</a> to get started.</p>','device-phone-mobile',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Reaching customers on both iOS and Android affordably\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Delivering reliable offline experiences\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Keeping apps secure and up to date\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"One team for app and backend\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Faster time to market\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Consistent brand experience\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Store submission support\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"device-phone-mobile\", \"title\": \"Cross-platform apps\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"device-phone-mobile\", \"title\": \"Push notifications\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"device-phone-mobile\", \"title\": \"Offline sync\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"device-phone-mobile\", \"title\": \"In-app payments\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"device-phone-mobile\", \"title\": \"Device integrations\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"device-phone-mobile\", \"title\": \"App analytics\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a mobile application development project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',1,2,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(4,1,'SaaS Product Development','saas-product-development','From MVP to multi-tenant platform','Plan, build and scale subscription software with multi-tenancy, billing and analytics built in.','We help founders and product teams turn ideas into reliable SaaS products — validating an MVP quickly, then evolving it into a secure, multi-tenant platform with subscriptions, onboarding and usage analytics.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>A SaaS product is not a one-off project — it is a platform that many customers rely on simultaneously, pay for every month and expect to improve continuously. Getting the foundations right early saves enormous effort later. <strong>The challenge is balancing speed to market with an architecture that can scale</strong>, so you can validate quickly without painting yourself into a corner.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MVP definition and delivery</strong> focused on one core workflow done exceptionally well.</li>\n<li><strong>Multi-tenant architecture</strong> with secure data isolation between customers.</li>\n<li><strong>Subscription billing</strong>, plans, trials and invoices through established payment providers.</li>\n<li><strong>Self-service onboarding</strong> that guides new customers to their first success.</li>\n<li><strong>Admin and support consoles</strong> for your own team.</li>\n<li><strong>Product analytics</strong> to measure activation, engagement and retention.</li>\n<li><strong>Public APIs, SSO and enterprise features</strong> as you move upmarket.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start by clarifying the customer, the problem and how you will measure success. A focused discovery produces a lean MVP scope and an architecture that leaves room to grow — typically a well-structured modular application on managed cloud infrastructure, deployed automatically from day one. We build iteratively, release frequently and use real usage data to prioritise the roadmap.</p>\n<p>Security and reliability are designed in: strong authentication with multi-factor options, role-based permissions within each customer account, encryption, backups, monitoring and audit logs. These are increasingly what business customers check before they buy.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits founders launching a new SaaS product, established companies turning an internal tool into a commercial platform, and SaaS businesses that need to scale or modernise an existing product. Our article on <a href=\"/blog/saas-product-development-from-mvp-to-scale\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SaaS product development from MVP to scale</a> explains the journey in more detail.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Success means customers can sign up, reach value quickly and keep coming back. Your team can see activation and retention clearly, release improvements frequently and onboard larger customers with confidence in security and reliability.</p>\n\n<h2>Long-term partnership</h2>\n<p>SaaS products succeed through continuous improvement. We can provide a dedicated team for ongoing development, or flexible support as your own team grows — see our <a href=\"/engagement-models\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">engagement models</a>. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Start a project</a> to discuss your product.</p>','cube-transparent',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Validating an idea without overbuilding\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Designing for multi-tenancy and scale\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Handling billing, onboarding and churn\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Lean MVP delivery\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Architecture ready to scale\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Built-in subscription billing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Product analytics from day one\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"cube-transparent\", \"title\": \"Multi-tenant architecture\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cube-transparent\", \"title\": \"Subscription billing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cube-transparent\", \"title\": \"Self-service onboarding\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cube-transparent\", \"title\": \"Admin and support consoles\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cube-transparent\", \"title\": \"Usage metering\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cube-transparent\", \"title\": \"Public APIs\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a saas product development project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,3,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(5,1,'E-commerce Development','e-commerce-development','Online stores built to convert','Custom and platform-based e-commerce with fast checkout, integrations and conversion-focused UX.','We build e-commerce experiences that are fast, trustworthy and easy to manage — integrating payments, inventory, shipping and marketing tools so you can sell confidently online.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Online shoppers have little patience. Slow pages, confusing navigation or a complicated checkout send them elsewhere in seconds. At the same time, growing retailers juggle inventory across channels, complex shipping rules and a constant stream of promotions. <strong>Effective e-commerce combines a fast, trustworthy storefront with reliable operations behind the scenes.</strong></p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Storefronts</strong> — platform-based, custom or headless — optimised for speed and mobile.</li>\n<li><strong>Checkout and payments</strong> with trusted gateways and clear delivery options.</li>\n<li><strong>Catalogue management</strong> for products, variants, pricing and promotions.</li>\n<li><strong>Inventory and order integrations</strong> with ERP, warehouse and shipping systems.</li>\n<li><strong>Marketplace connections</strong> to sell across multiple channels.</li>\n<li><strong>Personalisation and recommendations</strong>, including AI-powered suggestions.</li>\n<li><strong>Analytics</strong> covering conversion, basket value and customer behaviour.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start by understanding your customers, catalogue and operations, then recommend the right foundation: a proven platform where it fits, or a custom or headless approach where you need flexibility. We design the shopping journey around clarity and trust, build integrations so data flows automatically, and test thoroughly — including peak-load scenarios for seasonal sales.</p>\n<p>Search visibility matters for retail, so we build with clean URLs, structured product data, fast performance and accessible markup. Security covers payment handling through compliant providers, secure accounts and protection against common attacks.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>Our e-commerce development service suits brands launching online, retailers replatforming from an outdated store, and B2B companies that need ordering portals with account-specific pricing. Retail organisations can also explore our <a href=\"/industries/retail-e-commerce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">retail and e-commerce industry page</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>A successful store loads quickly on mobile, makes products easy to find and checks customers out without friction. Orders, stock levels and customer data stay in sync across your systems automatically, so your team spends less time on administration and more on merchandising and service. Analytics reveal where shoppers hesitate, guiding continuous improvements to conversion and basket value.</p>\n\n<p>Seasonal peaks are planned for with load testing and scalable hosting, so promotions and sales events run smoothly.</p>\n\n<h2>Grow with confidence</h2>\n<p>After launch, we help you optimise conversion, add features and keep the platform secure and up to date. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tell us about your store</a> and we will suggest the most effective approach.</p>','shopping-cart',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Slow storefronts and abandoned carts\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Inventory spread across channels\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Complex shipping and tax rules\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Faster, smoother checkout\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Unified inventory and orders\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Easy catalogue management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Scales for peak demand\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"shopping-cart\", \"title\": \"Headless commerce\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shopping-cart\", \"title\": \"Payment gateways\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shopping-cart\", \"title\": \"Inventory sync\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shopping-cart\", \"title\": \"Promotions and coupons\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shopping-cart\", \"title\": \"Order management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shopping-cart\", \"title\": \"Marketplace integrations\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a e-commerce development project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,4,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(6,1,'API Development & System Integration','api-development-system-integration','Make your systems work together','Secure APIs and integrations that connect your applications, partners and data sources.','We design well-documented, secure APIs and integrate the systems you already rely on — CRMs, ERPs, payment providers and SaaS tools — so data flows reliably without manual effort.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Most organisations run on a mix of systems: CRM, ERP, accounting, e-commerce, marketing tools and industry-specific software. When these systems do not talk to each other, people fill the gaps — copying data, reconciling spreadsheets and chasing updates. <strong>Well-designed APIs and integrations let information flow automatically</strong>, reducing errors and freeing your team for higher-value work.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>REST and GraphQL APIs</strong> for your applications, mobile apps and partners.</li>\n<li><strong>System integrations</strong> between CRMs, ERPs, payment providers, marketing and SaaS tools.</li>\n<li><strong>Webhooks and event-driven workflows</strong> that react to changes in real time.</li>\n<li><strong>Data synchronisation</strong> with conflict handling and audit trails.</li>\n<li><strong>API security</strong>: authentication, authorisation, rate limiting and secret management.</li>\n<li><strong>Documentation and developer portals</strong> so others can integrate confidently.</li>\n<li><strong>Monitoring and alerting</strong> for every integration.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We map the systems involved, the data that needs to move and the business events that should trigger it. Third-party APIs are assessed early because their quality, limits and test environments carry the most uncertainty. We then design integrations to be resilient: queued processing, retries, idempotency so repeated messages do not create duplicates, and clear error handling with alerts.</p>\n<p>APIs we build are versioned, documented and covered by automated tests, so changes do not break the applications and partners that depend on them.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations with disconnected systems, businesses preparing to automate processes, product teams that need a backend for web and mobile apps, and companies opening their platform to partners. Integration is often the foundation for <a href=\"/services/business-process-automation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">business process automation</a> and <a href=\"/services/generative-ai-ai-agent-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI agents</a>, which act through the same APIs.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>When integrations work well, people stop noticing them. Orders appear in the ERP without re-keying, customer updates flow into the CRM automatically, finance no longer reconciles exports by hand and partners integrate with your platform using clear documentation. Behind the scenes, every integration is monitored, failures are retried or flagged with useful context, and changes to connected systems are caught in testing rather than discovered by users. That reliability is what turns integration from a recurring headache into a durable business asset.</p>\n\n<h2>Get your systems working together</h2>\n<p>Read our guide to <a href=\"/blog/business-process-automation-where-to-start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">automation priorities</a>, or <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">describe your systems</a> and we will propose an integration approach.</p>','arrows-right-left',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Data trapped in disconnected systems\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Fragile point-to-point integrations\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Partners needing secure access to your data\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Reliable automated data flow\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Documented, versioned APIs\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Secure partner access\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Less manual reconciliation\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"arrows-right-left\", \"title\": \"REST and GraphQL APIs\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrows-right-left\", \"title\": \"Webhooks and event streams\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrows-right-left\", \"title\": \"Third-party integrations\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrows-right-left\", \"title\": \"API gateways and auth\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrows-right-left\", \"title\": \"Data synchronisation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrows-right-left\", \"title\": \"Monitoring and alerting\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a api development project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,5,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(7,2,'AI & Machine Learning Solutions','ai-machine-learning-solutions','Practical AI that delivers measurable value','Predictive models, computer vision and NLP solutions designed around real business problems.','We identify where AI can genuinely help — forecasting, classification, recommendation, document understanding — then build, evaluate and deploy models responsibly, with monitoring to keep them accurate over time.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Artificial intelligence can forecast demand, detect anomalies, classify documents, inspect images and personalise experiences — but only when it is applied to the right problem with the right data. Too many AI initiatives stop at impressive prototypes. <strong>Our focus is practical AI that reaches production and delivers measurable value</strong>, with the governance needed to trust it.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Use-case discovery</strong> to prioritise opportunities by value, feasibility and risk.</li>\n<li><strong>Predictive analytics</strong> for forecasting, churn, lead scoring and maintenance.</li>\n<li><strong>Classification and anomaly detection</strong> for documents, transactions and operations.</li>\n<li><strong>Computer vision</strong> for quality inspection, document capture and visual search.</li>\n<li><strong>Natural language processing</strong> for extraction, sentiment and routing.</li>\n<li><strong>Recommendation systems</strong> for products, content and next-best actions.</li>\n<li><strong>MLOps</strong>: deployment pipelines, monitoring and retraining.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We begin with the business problem and a clear measure of success, then assess the data. Models are developed with proper evaluation against held-out data and realistic baselines, so improvements are genuine. We consider fairness, explainability and privacy as part of design, especially where outputs affect people.</p>\n<p>Production deployment includes integration with your applications, monitoring of accuracy and data drift, and processes for retraining. Where decisions matter, we design human review into the workflow. Our guide on <a href=\"/blog/how-to-identify-high-value-ai-use-cases-in-your-business\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">identifying high-value AI use cases</a> explains our prioritisation approach.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations with valuable data and a clear problem to solve — such as operations teams forecasting demand, finance teams detecting anomalies or manufacturers automating inspection. If your data is not yet ready, our <a href=\"/services/data-analytics-business-intelligence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">data analytics and BI</a> service can build the foundations first.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>A successful AI project ends with a model that people actually use: integrated into an existing workflow, trusted because its accuracy has been measured honestly, and supported by clear processes for monitoring and improvement. Typical outcomes include faster decisions, earlier warnings of problems, more consistent classification and reduced manual review — always measured against the baseline agreed at the start. Just as important, a good engagement tells you when AI is <em>not</em> the right answer, saving investment for opportunities with stronger evidence.</p>\n\n<h2>Responsible AI</h2>\n<p>We build AI that is transparent about its limits, respects data protection obligations and keeps people accountable for important decisions. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discuss your AI idea</a> with our team.</p>','cpu-chip',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Unclear where AI will create real value\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Data quality and availability issues\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Moving models from prototype to production\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Use cases prioritised by impact\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Responsible, explainable models\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Production-grade deployment\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Ongoing monitoring and retraining\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"cpu-chip\", \"title\": \"Predictive analytics\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cpu-chip\", \"title\": \"Computer vision\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cpu-chip\", \"title\": \"Natural language processing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cpu-chip\", \"title\": \"Recommendation engines\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cpu-chip\", \"title\": \"Anomaly detection\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cpu-chip\", \"title\": \"MLOps pipelines\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a ai project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',1,6,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:32',NULL,NULL),(8,2,'Generative AI & AI Agent Development','generative-ai-ai-agent-development','Assistants and agents grounded in your knowledge','LLM-powered assistants, retrieval-augmented search and AI agents that work safely with your data and tools.','We build generative AI applications that are useful and safe: knowledge assistants grounded in your documents, agents that automate multi-step tasks with human oversight, and integrations that keep sensitive data protected.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Generative AI can summarise documents, answer questions, draft content and — with AI agents — complete multi-step tasks across your systems. The opportunity is real, but so are the risks: inaccurate answers, data exposure and unpredictable behaviour. <strong>We build generative AI solutions that are useful, grounded in your knowledge and safe to operate.</strong></p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Knowledge assistants</strong> that answer questions from your documents with citations, using <a href=\"/blog/retrieval-augmented-generation-explained-for-business-leaders\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">retrieval-augmented generation</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>AI agents</strong> that plan and act through narrowly scoped tools, with approval steps for important actions.</li>\n<li><strong>Document intelligence</strong> for summarisation, extraction and classification.</li>\n<li><strong>Customer and employee support assistants</strong> integrated with your help desk and CRM.</li>\n<li><strong>Content and drafting tools</strong> with human review built in.</li>\n<li><strong>Evaluation frameworks and guardrails</strong> to measure and control quality.</li>\n<li><strong>Usage, cost and quality monitoring</strong> in production.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start with a focused use case and a measurable outcome, then design the solution around your data and permissions. Retrieval respects who is allowed to see what. Agents receive least-privilege tools rather than broad system access, and treat external content as untrusted input. Before scaling, we evaluate with realistic test sets and pilot with real users, comparing results against a baseline.</p>\n<p>In production, we monitor quality, cost and user feedback, and improve prompts, retrieval and tools as your content and processes change. Read our guide to <a href=\"/blog/what-are-ai-agents-a-practical-guide-for-business-leaders\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI agents for business</a> for more on safe adoption.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations with large volumes of documents and knowledge, support teams handling repetitive questions, operations teams processing unstructured information, and leaders who want to move from AI experiments to reliable production solutions. Smaller businesses can explore our article on <a href=\"/blog/generative-ai-use-cases-for-small-and-mid-sized-businesses\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">generative AI use cases for SMEs</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Success means people rely on the assistant because its answers are accurate, cited and appropriate to their role. Repetitive work shrinks, response times improve and experts spend more time on judgement. Usage, cost and quality are visible on a dashboard, and every agent action can be traced and reviewed.</p>\n\n<h2>Start with confidence</h2>\n<p>We help you pick the right first use case, prove its value and scale responsibly. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Talk to us about generative AI</a>.</p>','sparkles',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Hallucinations and inaccurate answers\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Protecting sensitive company data\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Integrating AI into existing workflows\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Answers grounded in your sources\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Guardrails and human review\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Data privacy controls\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Measurable productivity gains\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"sparkles\", \"title\": \"Retrieval-augmented generation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"sparkles\", \"title\": \"Custom AI assistants\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"sparkles\", \"title\": \"Tool-using AI agents\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"sparkles\", \"title\": \"Document summarisation and extraction\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"sparkles\", \"title\": \"Evaluation and guardrails\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"sparkles\", \"title\": \"Usage and cost monitoring\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a generative ai project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',1,7,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(9,2,'Business Process Automation','business-process-automation','Automate the repetitive, focus on what matters','Workflow automation that removes manual steps, reduces errors and frees your team for higher-value work.','We map your processes, find the bottlenecks and automate them — combining integrations, workflow engines, RPA and AI document processing so work moves faster with fewer errors.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Every organisation has work that follows the same steps again and again: re-keying data, chasing approvals, compiling reports and moving information between systems. This work is slow, error-prone and rarely the best use of skilled people. <strong>Business process automation removes repetitive steps</strong> so work moves faster, mistakes fall and your team can focus on customers and improvement.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Process discovery and mapping</strong> to find and simplify the best candidates.</li>\n<li><strong>Workflow automation</strong> for approvals, notifications, task routing and escalations.</li>\n<li><strong>System integrations</strong> that move data automatically between applications.</li>\n<li><strong>Document and invoice processing</strong> using AI extraction with human review.</li>\n<li><strong>Robotic process automation</strong> for legacy systems without APIs.</li>\n<li><strong>Scheduled jobs and reports</strong> generated and distributed automatically.</li>\n<li><strong>Process dashboards</strong> showing volumes, exceptions and time saved.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We map the process with the people who do the work, remove unnecessary steps and quantify the opportunity against a baseline. Then we choose the right technique for each step — integration where an API exists, AI where documents or language need interpretation, workflow tools for approvals — and design clear exception handling.</p>\n<p>Automations are rolled out with your team, not to them: pilot groups, training and feedback loops. Every automation has monitoring, logging and an owner, so it stays reliable as connected systems change. Our guide to <a href=\"/blog/business-process-automation-where-to-start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">where to start with automation</a> explains the approach step by step.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits finance, operations, HR and customer service teams handling high volumes of repetitive work, and growing businesses that want to scale without adding equivalent headcount. For tasks that require judgement across several steps, we also build <a href=\"/services/generative-ai-ai-agent-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI agents</a> with guardrails.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Good automation is measured in outcomes: shorter turnaround times, fewer errors, faster responses to customers and hours released for higher-value work. Staff trust the automation because exceptions reach them with context, and managers can see volumes and bottlenecks on a dashboard. Over time, a register of automations with clear owners makes it easy to expand the programme safely.</p>\n\n<h2>Measurable results</h2>\n<p>We agree success measures up front — processing time, error rates, exceptions and staff time released — and report against them. <a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tell us which processes slow you down</a>.</p>','cog-6-tooth',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Repetitive manual data entry\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Approval bottlenecks and delays\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Errors from copy-paste work\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Fewer manual steps\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Faster turnaround\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Consistent, auditable processes\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Teams focused on higher-value work\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"cog-6-tooth\", \"title\": \"Workflow automation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cog-6-tooth\", \"title\": \"Document and invoice processing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cog-6-tooth\", \"title\": \"Approval routing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cog-6-tooth\", \"title\": \"Scheduled jobs and alerts\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cog-6-tooth\", \"title\": \"Integration bots\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cog-6-tooth\", \"title\": \"Process dashboards\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a business process automation project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,8,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(10,2,'Data Analytics & Business Intelligence','data-analytics-business-intelligence','Decisions backed by trustworthy data','Data pipelines, warehouses and dashboards that give every team a single source of truth.','We consolidate data from your systems into a reliable warehouse, model it for analysis and deliver dashboards and reports that help leaders and teams make confident decisions.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>When reports from different teams show different numbers, meetings become debates about whose spreadsheet is right. Manual reporting takes hours each week and is out of date by the time it is shared. <strong>A reliable data foundation gives everyone a single source of truth</strong>, so decisions are faster, better and based on evidence.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Data pipelines</strong> that extract and load data from your applications automatically.</li>\n<li><strong>Data warehouses</strong> modelled around your business concepts.</li>\n<li><strong>Interactive dashboards</strong> for leadership, operations, sales and finance.</li>\n<li><strong>KPI frameworks</strong> that define metrics consistently across the organisation.</li>\n<li><strong>Automated reporting</strong> delivered on a schedule.</li>\n<li><strong>Forecasting and advanced analytics</strong> where the data supports it.</li>\n<li><strong>Data quality monitoring</strong> and governance.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start by understanding the decisions you need to make and the questions you need to answer, then trace the data required back to its sources. We build pipelines and models incrementally, delivering useful dashboards early rather than waiting for a perfect warehouse. Definitions for key metrics are agreed with stakeholders and documented, so &#34;revenue&#34; or &#34;active customer&#34; means the same thing everywhere.</p>\n<p>Access controls ensure people see the data they should, and quality checks flag problems before they reach reports. As the foundation matures, it becomes the base for <a href=\"/services/ai-machine-learning-solutions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">machine learning</a> and natural-language analytics.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations with data spread across several systems, leadership teams that lack timely visibility, and growing businesses that have outgrown spreadsheet reporting. It is also a common first step before AI projects — see <a href=\"/blog/how-to-identify-high-value-ai-use-cases-in-your-business\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">how to identify high-value AI use cases</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Success means leaders and teams open the same dashboards and see the same numbers. Weekly reports arrive automatically instead of taking hours to assemble, definitions of key metrics are documented and agreed, and data quality issues are flagged before they mislead anyone. Teams can explore data themselves within governed boundaries, and the analytics foundation is ready to support forecasting and AI initiatives when the organisation is ready to take that step.</p>\n\n<h2>Turn data into decisions</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tell us about your reporting challenges</a> and we will propose a pragmatic roadmap.</p>','presentation-chart-line',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Conflicting numbers across reports\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Slow, manual reporting\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Data spread across many systems\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Single source of truth\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Self-service dashboards\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Automated reporting\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Data governance and quality\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"presentation-chart-line\", \"title\": \"Data pipelines (ETL/ELT)\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"presentation-chart-line\", \"title\": \"Data warehousing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"presentation-chart-line\", \"title\": \"Interactive dashboards\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"presentation-chart-line\", \"title\": \"KPI frameworks\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"presentation-chart-line\", \"title\": \"Forecasting\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"presentation-chart-line\", \"title\": \"Data quality monitoring\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a data analytics project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,9,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(11,3,'Cloud Computing & Cloud Migration','cloud-computing-cloud-migration','Move to the cloud with confidence','Cloud strategy, migration and optimisation across AWS, Azure and Google Cloud.','We plan and execute cloud migrations with minimal disruption, then optimise your environment for cost, performance, resilience and security.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Ageing servers, manual deployments and fragile backups put businesses at risk and slow down innovation. The cloud offers scalability, resilience and access to powerful managed services — but migrations can go wrong when dependencies are missed, security is an afterthought or costs are not controlled. <strong>A well-planned migration reduces risk and sets you up to keep improving.</strong></p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cloud readiness assessments</strong> covering applications, data, dependencies and costs.</li>\n<li><strong>Migration strategy</strong> per workload: rehost, re-platform, refactor, replace or retire.</li>\n<li><strong>Secure landing zones</strong> with identity, networking, logging and guardrails as code.</li>\n<li><strong>Phased migrations</strong> with rehearsed cut-overs and rollback plans.</li>\n<li><strong>Serverless and container platforms</strong> for modern applications.</li>\n<li><strong>Cost optimisation</strong> with tagging, budgets, alerts and right-sizing.</li>\n<li><strong>Backup and disaster recovery</strong> designed around your recovery objectives.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We inventory your systems and map dependencies, agree success measures and constraints, and design the target architecture. Foundations come first: a secure, automated landing zone. Workloads then move in waves, starting with lower-risk systems, with thorough validation and clear communication to users. After go-live, we monitor performance and costs, optimise resources and decommission legacy infrastructure.</p>\n<p>Everything is defined as infrastructure as code where possible, so environments are reproducible, reviewable and easy to recover. Our <a href=\"/blog/a-practical-checklist-for-migrating-to-the-cloud\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cloud migration checklist</a> outlines the full process.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations with on-premise infrastructure approaching end of life, businesses with unpredictable cloud bills, and teams that want to modernise applications using managed cloud services. It pairs naturally with our <a href=\"/services/devops-cicd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DevOps and CI/CD</a> practice.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>After a successful migration, deployments are automated, environments are consistent and recovery from failures is fast and rehearsed. Costs are visible by application and team, with budgets and alerts preventing surprises. Legacy hardware has been retired, security controls are applied consistently, and your team understands how to operate and evolve the new platform. Most importantly, the business can launch new services faster because infrastructure is no longer a bottleneck.</p>\n\n<p>We also help you choose between providers and services objectively, explaining the trade-offs between managed services, containers and serverless options so architecture decisions match your skills and budget.</p>\n\n<h2>Plan your move</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Request a cloud readiness conversation</a> and we will outline a low-risk path.</p>','cloud-arrow-up',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Ageing on-premise infrastructure\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Unpredictable cloud costs\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Downtime risk during migration\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Phased, low-risk migration\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Optimised cloud spend\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"High availability and backups\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Infrastructure as code\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"cloud-arrow-up\", \"title\": \"Cloud readiness assessment\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cloud-arrow-up\", \"title\": \"Lift-and-shift and re-platforming\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cloud-arrow-up\", \"title\": \"Serverless and containers\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cloud-arrow-up\", \"title\": \"Cost optimisation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cloud-arrow-up\", \"title\": \"Disaster recovery\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"cloud-arrow-up\", \"title\": \"Multi-cloud strategy\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a cloud computing project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',1,10,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(12,3,'DevOps & CI/CD','devops-cicd','Ship faster, safely','Automated pipelines, infrastructure as code and observability for reliable, frequent releases.','We introduce DevOps practices that let your teams release confidently — automated testing and deployment pipelines, reproducible infrastructure and monitoring that catches issues before users do.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>When releases are manual and risky, teams deploy less often, batch more changes together and spend weekends fixing problems. Environments drift apart, and nobody is quite sure what is running in production. <strong>DevOps practices make releases routine</strong>: automated, repeatable and observable, so you can deliver improvements quickly without sacrificing stability.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CI/CD pipelines</strong> with automated builds, tests, quality checks and deployments.</li>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure as code</strong> for reproducible, reviewable environments.</li>\n<li><strong>Containerisation and orchestration</strong> where it adds value.</li>\n<li><strong>Monitoring, logging and alerting</strong> so issues are spotted before users report them.</li>\n<li><strong>Automated security scanning</strong> of dependencies, containers and configuration.</li>\n<li><strong>Zero-downtime deployment strategies</strong> and fast rollback.</li>\n<li><strong>Secrets management</strong> and least-privilege access for pipelines.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We assess your current delivery process — from commit to production — and identify the biggest sources of delay and risk. Improvements are introduced incrementally: automated tests and builds first, then repeatable deployments, infrastructure as code and observability. We document runbooks and share knowledge so your team owns the improved process.</p>\n<p>We keep solutions proportionate. Not every application needs complex orchestration; many benefit most from a reliable pipeline, good monitoring and a simple, well-understood hosting setup.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits product teams that want to release more often, organisations with fragile manual deployments, and businesses migrating to the cloud. It complements our <a href=\"/services/cloud-computing-cloud-migration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cloud migration</a> and <a href=\"/services/maintenance-technical-support\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">maintenance</a> services.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>With mature DevOps practices, releasing becomes a routine, low-stress event that can happen whenever a change is ready. Automated tests and checks catch problems before production, deployments are repeatable and quick to roll back, and monitoring shows how the system behaves in real time. Engineers spend less time on manual operations and firefighting, and more time building improvements. Infrastructure changes are reviewed like code, giving you a clear history of what changed, when and why — invaluable for troubleshooting and audits.</p>\n\n<p>We favour simple, well-documented setups that your own team can understand and maintain, introducing more advanced tooling only when it solves a real problem such as scaling, compliance or release frequency.</p>\n\n<h2>Ship faster, safely</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tell us how you deploy today</a> and we will suggest practical improvements.</p>','arrow-path-rounded-square',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Slow, risky manual releases\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Environments that drift apart\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Limited visibility into production\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Frequent, reliable releases\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Reproducible environments\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Faster incident response\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Security checks in the pipeline\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"arrow-path-rounded-square\", \"title\": \"CI/CD pipelines\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-path-rounded-square\", \"title\": \"Infrastructure as code\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-path-rounded-square\", \"title\": \"Containerisation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-path-rounded-square\", \"title\": \"Monitoring and alerting\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-path-rounded-square\", \"title\": \"Automated security scanning\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-path-rounded-square\", \"title\": \"Zero-downtime deployments\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a devops project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,11,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(13,3,'IT Infrastructure & Managed IT Services','it-infrastructure-managed-it-services','Reliable IT, proactively managed','Proactive monitoring, maintenance and support for servers, networks, devices and cloud services.','We keep your infrastructure healthy and secure with proactive monitoring, patching, backups and responsive support, so your team can focus on the business.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Technology problems rarely happen at a convenient time. Unpatched devices, failed backups and overloaded networks lead to downtime, security incidents and frustrated staff. Many growing organisations do not have the capacity to manage IT proactively. <strong>Managed IT services keep your infrastructure healthy and secure</strong>, so your team can focus on the business.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Proactive monitoring</strong> of servers, cloud services and critical systems.</li>\n<li><strong>Patch management</strong> for operating systems and applications.</li>\n<li><strong>Backup and recovery</strong> with regular restore testing.</li>\n<li><strong>Endpoint management</strong> for laptops and mobile devices, including encryption.</li>\n<li><strong>Network management</strong> and secure remote access.</li>\n<li><strong>Microsoft 365 and cloud administration</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Help desk support</strong> with agreed response times.</li>\n<li><strong>Regular reviews</strong> and technology roadmaps.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start with an assessment of your environment: devices, systems, security controls, backups and support needs. We then agree a service scope and response times, onboard your systems into monitoring and management tools, and address the most urgent risks first. Regular reviews track incidents, recommendations and upcoming changes such as hardware renewals or licence changes.</p>\n<p>Security is integral to day-to-day management: multi-factor authentication, least-privilege access, timely patching and tested backups. For a broader view, see our <a href=\"/blog/cybersecurity-checklist-for-growing-businesses\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cybersecurity checklist for growing businesses</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations without dedicated IT staff, internal IT teams that need extra capacity or specialist skills, and businesses preparing for growth or cloud migration. Larger security needs are covered by our <a href=\"/services/cybersecurity-consulting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cybersecurity consulting</a> service.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>With well-managed IT, problems are prevented rather than repeatedly fixed. Devices and systems are patched on schedule, backups are verified, users get help quickly when they need it and leadership receives regular reports on incidents, risks and recommendations. Planned upgrades replace emergency purchases, licences are kept under control and the IT environment is ready to support growth, new offices or cloud migration without disruption to daily work.</p>\n\n<p>We document your environment thoroughly — devices, licences, accounts and configurations — so knowledge is never held by a single person and changes can be made safely and quickly when your organisation needs them.</p>\n\n<h2>Reliable IT, proactively managed</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/contact\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get in touch</a> to arrange an assessment of your current IT environment.</p>','server-stack',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Unplanned downtime\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Patching and backups falling behind\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Limited in-house IT capacity\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Proactive monitoring\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Predictable monthly costs\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Regular patching and backups\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Responsive help desk\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"server-stack\", \"title\": \"24/7 monitoring options\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"server-stack\", \"title\": \"Patch management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"server-stack\", \"title\": \"Backup and recovery\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"server-stack\", \"title\": \"Network management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"server-stack\", \"title\": \"Endpoint management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"server-stack\", \"title\": \"Help desk support\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a it infrastructure project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,12,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(14,3,'Cybersecurity Consulting','cybersecurity-consulting','Security built into every layer','Security assessments, secure architecture and practical roadmaps to reduce risk.','We assess your applications and infrastructure, prioritise risks and help you implement practical controls — from secure coding and identity management to incident readiness.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Cyber threats affect organisations of every size, and the consequences — downtime, data loss, financial fraud and reputational damage — can be severe. Yet security advice is often generic, alarming or impossible to act on. <strong>We provide clear, prioritised recommendations</strong> that reduce real risk and fit the way your organisation works.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Security assessments</strong> of your people, processes and technology.</li>\n<li><strong>Application security reviews</strong> for web and mobile applications and APIs.</li>\n<li><strong>Cloud security hardening</strong> for AWS, Azure and Google Cloud environments.</li>\n<li><strong>Identity and access management</strong>: MFA, single sign-on and least privilege.</li>\n<li><strong>Secure development practices</strong> embedded into your delivery process.</li>\n<li><strong>Incident response planning</strong> and tabletop exercises.</li>\n<li><strong>Security awareness training</strong> focused on phishing and payment fraud.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We begin by understanding what matters most: critical systems, sensitive data and the threats most relevant to your sector. An assessment identifies gaps and ranks them by risk and effort, giving you a roadmap with quick wins and longer-term improvements. We can then help implement the changes — configuring controls, improving application code and setting up monitoring — or support your team to do so.</p>\n<p>Recommendations are written for decision-makers as well as technical teams, so leadership can understand trade-offs and allocate resources confidently. Our <a href=\"/blog/cybersecurity-checklist-for-growing-businesses\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cybersecurity checklist</a> is a good starting point for self-assessment.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations handling sensitive data, businesses preparing for customer security reviews, companies launching new digital products and teams that want independent assurance on their current controls. It complements our <a href=\"/services/it-infrastructure-managed-it-services\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">managed IT services</a> and secure <a href=\"/services/custom-software-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">software development</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Success is a measurable reduction in risk: critical gaps closed first, controls such as multi-factor authentication and least-privilege access applied consistently, backups that have been proven to restore, and a team that knows what to do when something goes wrong. Leadership receives a clear picture of remaining risks and a realistic plan for addressing them. Customers and partners gain confidence when you can answer their security questions with evidence rather than assurances.</p>\n\n<p>Security improvements are tracked and reviewed so progress is visible.</p>\n\n<h2>Reduce risk with confidence</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/contact\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Contact us</a> to discuss a security assessment tailored to your organisation.</p>','shield-check',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Unknown vulnerabilities in apps and infrastructure\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Compliance and audit pressure\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Limited security expertise in-house\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Prioritised, actionable findings\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Secure-by-design architecture\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Improved compliance posture\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Team awareness and training\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"shield-check\", \"title\": \"Security assessments\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shield-check\", \"title\": \"Application security reviews\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shield-check\", \"title\": \"Identity and access management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shield-check\", \"title\": \"Cloud security hardening\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shield-check\", \"title\": \"Incident response planning\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"shield-check\", \"title\": \"Security awareness training\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a cybersecurity consulting project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,13,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(15,4,'CRM & ERP Solutions','crm-erp-solutions','One connected view of customers and operations','Implementation, customisation and integration of CRM and ERP platforms — or custom-built alternatives.','Whether you need to configure a leading platform or build a tailored system, we deliver CRM and ERP solutions that unify sales, operations, finance and service data.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>When customer information lives in inboxes and spreadsheets, and operations, inventory and finance run on separate tools, teams waste time and customers notice the gaps. <strong>CRM and ERP systems bring sales, service, operations and finance together</strong>, giving everyone a shared, accurate view of the business.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CRM implementation</strong> for pipeline management, customer service and marketing.</li>\n<li><strong>ERP customisation</strong> for inventory, procurement, production and finance.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom modules</strong> where off-the-shelf features do not fit your process.</li>\n<li><strong>Fully custom CRM/ERP systems</strong> for organisations with distinctive operations.</li>\n<li><strong>Integrations</strong> with e-commerce, accounting, email and other tools.</li>\n<li><strong>Data migration</strong> from legacy systems and spreadsheets.</li>\n<li><strong>Automation and reporting</strong> to remove manual work and improve visibility.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We map your customer journey and core operational processes, identify where information breaks down and define what the system must do. We then recommend the right approach — configuring a leading platform, extending it with custom modules or building a tailored system — with an objective view of costs and trade-offs. Our article on <a href=\"/blog/custom-software-vs-off-the-shelf-how-to-choose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">custom vs off-the-shelf software</a> explains the framework we use.</p>\n<p>Implementation is phased to deliver value early and reduce disruption. Data migration is rehearsed and validated, and roll-out includes training and support so the system is adopted, not just installed.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits growing businesses outgrowing spreadsheets, organisations with several disconnected systems, and companies whose current CRM or ERP no longer fits how they work. Integration work is supported by our <a href=\"/services/api-development-system-integration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API and system integration</a> team.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Success means one trusted record for every customer and order, with sales, service, operations and finance working from the same information. Manual reconciliation disappears, managers access real-time reporting instead of compiling spreadsheets, and new staff learn a single system rather than a patchwork of tools. Adoption is measured as carefully as delivery, because a system people avoid delivers little value. Ongoing support keeps the platform aligned as your processes evolve and your organisation grows.</p>\n\n<p>Clear ownership and simple governance keep data clean long after launch.</p>\n\n<h2>One connected view of your business</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tell us about your current systems</a> and we will recommend a practical path forward.</p>','briefcase',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Customer data scattered across teams\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Manual order-to-cash processes\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Rigid systems that do not fit your workflow\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Unified customer and operational data\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Automated core processes\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Real-time reporting\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Tailored to your workflows\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"CRM implementation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"ERP customisation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"Sales pipeline automation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"Inventory and procurement\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"Finance integrations\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"Custom modules\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a crm project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,14,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(16,4,'Digital Transformation Consulting','digital-transformation-consulting','Strategy to execution','Technology strategy, roadmaps and change support to modernise your organisation step by step.','We help leadership teams define a pragmatic digital strategy, prioritise initiatives by value and risk, and deliver change in manageable steps that your people embrace.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Digital transformation is not about buying technology — it is about changing how an organisation creates value, using technology as an enabler. Many programmes struggle because priorities are unclear, initiatives are disconnected or people are not brought along. <strong>We help leadership teams define a pragmatic strategy and deliver it step by step.</strong></p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Digital maturity assessments</strong> across processes, data, technology and skills.</li>\n<li><strong>Prioritised technology roadmaps</strong> that balance value, risk and effort.</li>\n<li><strong>Process redesign</strong> to remove friction before automating.</li>\n<li><strong>Vendor and platform selection</strong> with objective evaluation criteria.</li>\n<li><strong>Business cases</strong> with clear outcomes and measures.</li>\n<li><strong>Change management</strong> and communication planning.</li>\n<li><strong>Programme governance</strong> and delivery support.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start with your strategy and pain points, interviewing leaders and frontline teams to understand where time, money and opportunities are being lost. We assess the current technology landscape and data, then co-create a roadmap with quick wins that build momentum alongside larger structural changes. Each initiative has an owner, outcome measures and a realistic plan.</p>\n<p>Because we also design and build software, data platforms, cloud environments and AI solutions, our recommendations are grounded in what is practical to deliver. Relevant reading includes our guides to <a href=\"/blog/business-process-automation-where-to-start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">process automation</a> and <a href=\"/blog/how-to-identify-high-value-ai-use-cases-in-your-business\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">high-value AI use cases</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits leadership teams planning modernisation, organisations whose previous technology initiatives stalled, and businesses that want an independent view of their options before investing. It is relevant across sectors — explore our <a href=\"/industries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">industries</a> to see common challenges.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>A successful transformation programme delivers visible improvements early and builds momentum from there. Teams understand why changes are happening and how they benefit, processes are simpler before they are automated, and technology investments are tied to measurable outcomes such as faster service, lower operating costs or new revenue. Regular reviews keep the roadmap aligned with strategy as markets and priorities change, so transformation becomes an ongoing capability rather than a one-off project.</p>\n\n<p>We keep recommendations vendor-neutral and grounded in delivery experience, so the roadmap reflects what will genuinely work for your people, budget and timescales rather than the latest trend.</p>\n\n<h2>Strategy to execution</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/contact\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Speak to our consultants</a> about where your organisation wants to go.</p>','globe-alt',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Unclear technology priorities\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Legacy processes slowing growth\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Change fatigue across teams\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Clear, prioritised roadmap\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Quick wins alongside long-term change\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Aligned business and IT\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Measurable outcomes\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"globe-alt\", \"title\": \"Digital maturity assessment\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"globe-alt\", \"title\": \"Technology roadmaps\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"globe-alt\", \"title\": \"Process re-engineering\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"globe-alt\", \"title\": \"Vendor selection\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"globe-alt\", \"title\": \"Change management\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"globe-alt\", \"title\": \"Programme governance\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a digital transformation consulting project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,15,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(17,5,'UI/UX Design','uiux-design','Interfaces people understand instantly','Research-led product design, prototypes and design systems for web and mobile.','We combine user research, information architecture and visual design to create intuitive, accessible experiences — and deliver design systems your developers can implement consistently.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Users judge products quickly. If an interface is confusing, slow or inaccessible, people abandon it — no matter how powerful the technology behind it. <strong>Good design makes complex things feel simple</strong>, increases adoption and reduces support costs. It also speeds up development, because teams build the right thing the first time.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>User research</strong>: interviews, observation and analysis of user needs.</li>\n<li><strong>Information architecture</strong> and user journey mapping.</li>\n<li><strong>Wireframes and interactive prototypes</strong> for early validation.</li>\n<li><strong>Visual design</strong> aligned with your brand.</li>\n<li><strong>Design systems</strong> with tokens and reusable components.</li>\n<li><strong>Usability testing</strong> before and after launch.</li>\n<li><strong>Accessibility audits</strong> against WCAG guidelines.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>We start by understanding your users, their goals and the context in which they work. We map journeys, identify pain points and explore solutions through sketches and prototypes, testing early with real people. Visual design follows, guided by your brand and accessibility standards — including colour contrast, readable typography and keyboard-friendly interactions.</p>\n<p>Designs are delivered as a structured design system so developers can implement them consistently and efficiently. Our article on <a href=\"/blog/why-design-systems-speed-up-product-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">why design systems speed up product development</a> explains the benefits.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits startups designing a new product, organisations modernising dated interfaces, and teams whose products suffer from low adoption or high support volume. It pairs naturally with our <a href=\"/services/web-application-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">web</a> and <a href=\"/services/mobile-application-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">mobile</a> development services.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>Good design shows up in behaviour: users complete key tasks quickly and without help, support requests fall, and adoption rises. Developers build faster because components and patterns are clearly defined in a shared design system, and accessibility is built in from the start rather than retrofitted. Design decisions are backed by research and testing, so stakeholders can discuss evidence instead of personal preferences — leading to quicker agreement, fewer revisions and better products for everyone involved.</p>\n\n<p>We document design decisions, accessibility requirements and component behaviour clearly, so developers, testers and future designers share the same understanding and the product stays consistent as new features are added over time.</p>\n\n<h2>Design that works for everyone</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/start-a-project\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Share your product goals</a> and we will propose a design approach.</p>','paint-brush',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Confusing journeys that lose users\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Inconsistent interfaces across products\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Accessibility gaps\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Validated with real users\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Accessible by default\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Consistent design systems\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Faster development handoff\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"paint-brush\", \"title\": \"User research\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"paint-brush\", \"title\": \"Wireframes and prototypes\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"paint-brush\", \"title\": \"Visual design\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"paint-brush\", \"title\": \"Design systems\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"paint-brush\", \"title\": \"Usability testing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"paint-brush\", \"title\": \"Accessibility audits\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a ui/ux design project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,16,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL),(18,5,'Maintenance & Technical Support','maintenance-technical-support','Keep your software healthy','Ongoing maintenance, updates, monitoring and enhancements for applications we build or inherit.','Software needs care after launch. We provide maintenance plans covering security updates, dependency upgrades, performance tuning, bug fixes and continuous improvements.','<h2>Why it matters</h2>\n<p>Software is never finished. Frameworks release security updates, browsers and operating systems change, integrations evolve and users request improvements. Neglected applications become insecure, slow and expensive to rescue. <strong>Regular maintenance keeps your software secure, reliable and valuable</strong> — and is far cheaper than emergency fixes or rebuilds.</p>\n\n<h2>What we deliver</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Security updates</strong> for frameworks, libraries and server software.</li>\n<li><strong>Dependency and framework upgrades</strong> to stay on supported versions.</li>\n<li><strong>Monitoring</strong> of uptime, errors and performance.</li>\n<li><strong>Bug fixing</strong> prioritised by severity.</li>\n<li><strong>Performance optimisation</strong> as usage grows.</li>\n<li><strong>Small enhancements</strong> and continuous improvements.</li>\n<li><strong>Backups and recovery checks</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Technical documentation</strong> kept up to date.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<p>For applications we have not built, we begin with a review of code quality, security, dependencies and infrastructure, and share a prioritised report. We then agree a support plan with clear scope, response times and reporting. Day to day, requests are logged and prioritised, updates are applied through tested deployment pipelines, and monitoring alerts us to issues early.</p>\n<p>Regular reviews look ahead: upcoming framework versions, technical debt worth addressing and improvements that would deliver the most value. This keeps your application healthy rather than just keeping it running.</p>\n\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This service suits organisations with business-critical applications, companies whose original developers are no longer available, and teams that want to free internal developers for new projects. If you are evaluating partners, our guide on <a href=\"/blog/how-to-choose-a-software-development-company\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">choosing a software development company</a> covers support questions to ask.</p>\n\n<h2>What success looks like</h2>\n<p>A well-maintained application stays on supported framework versions, receives security fixes promptly and performs consistently as usage grows. Issues are spotted through monitoring before most users notice them, and requests are resolved within agreed timeframes. You receive regular reports showing what was done and what is planned, so maintenance is transparent rather than a black box. Over time, steady improvements and reduced technical debt keep the application valuable and easier to extend.</p>\n\n<p>Where an application has accumulated technical debt, we propose a phased plan to address it alongside routine maintenance, so stability improves without disrupting users or pausing important feature work.</p>\n\n<h2>Keep your software healthy</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/contact\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get in touch</a> to discuss a maintenance plan or a code review of your application.</p>','lifebuoy',NULL,NULL,'[{\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Outdated dependencies and security risks\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"No owner for legacy applications\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"exclamation-triangle\", \"title\": \"Slow response to issues\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Regular security updates\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Clear response times\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Continuous improvement\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"check-badge\", \"title\": \"Knowledge retained in one team\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"lifebuoy\", \"title\": \"Security and dependency updates\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"lifebuoy\", \"title\": \"Bug fixing\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"lifebuoy\", \"title\": \"Performance optimisation\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"lifebuoy\", \"title\": \"Uptime monitoring\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"lifebuoy\", \"title\": \"Feature enhancements\", \"description\": null}, {\"icon\": \"lifebuoy\", \"title\": \"Technical documentation\", \"description\": null}]','[{\"icon\": \"magnifying-glass-circle\", \"title\": \"Discover\", \"description\": \"Workshops to understand your goals, users, constraints and how success will be measured.\"}, {\"icon\": \"map\", \"title\": \"Plan & design\", \"description\": \"Architecture, scope, roadmap and UX prototypes agreed before development starts.\"}, {\"icon\": \"code-bracket\", \"title\": \"Build iteratively\", \"description\": \"Short sprints with regular demos, code review and automated testing.\"}, {\"icon\": \"rocket-launch\", \"title\": \"Launch\", \"description\": \"Hardened deployment, data migration, monitoring and team handover.\"}, {\"icon\": \"arrow-trending-up\", \"title\": \"Support & evolve\", \"description\": \"Maintenance, optimisation and new features as your needs grow.\"}]','Planning a maintenance project?','Tell us what you are trying to achieve and we will suggest the right approach, team and next steps.','published','2026-10-26 02:36:55',0,17,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-26 02:36:55','2026-10-26 04:04:33',NULL,NULL);
